+# ASSPS Connect Parent Timetable — 2026-10-16 isolated change
+Parent dashboard + reports include FamilyTimetable.
+API GET /api/portal/family-timetable?day=<school weekday>.
+Only authenticated linked children from the backend; no arbitrary student_id or school_id query parameters.
+ASSPS school ID 1 approved version 2026–27. Other schools fail closed.
+Principal-approved Monday–Thursday/Saturday 08:30–13:30 with break; Friday 08:30–12:30 without break.
+Unverified junior subjects remain explicitly pending. Staff names do NOT authorize logins or marks-entry permissions.
+Backend must deploy first; until then frontend displays an error, never invented timetable data.
+No production cutover or real-account browser acceptance has occurred yet.
